Changes made in this conversion (Swift Open License v1.0, Section 4(b);
Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b)):

Source: ukisai/Swift-Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4, revision
17d5f9dfcb6e1e6ccbd11d93da2b60b7754f7fe4 (UkisAI's ModelOpt mixed NVFP4/FP8
quantization of Swift-Qwen3.8-27B).

  - All model files (*.safetensors, config, tokenizer, chat template, generation and
    processor configs) were converted into the single NInfer v3 artifact
    Swift-Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4-NInfer.ninfer with the qwen3_8_27b_nvfp4_nvidia recipe of
    Infernix's tools.convert.
  - MLP projections (NVFP4) and attention/GDN projections (FP8, row scales): codes and
    scales copied unchanged.
  - Output head: dequantized from NVFP4 and re-quantized to FP8 with one BF16 scale per
    row; token embedding: quantized from BF16 to FP8 with one BF16 scale per row.
  - MTP companion and vision tower: some projections re-quantized from BF16 to grouped
    8/6/5/4-bit integer formats with FP16 scales; other tensors kept as stored.
  - Added the DFlash2 draft model above and a proposal head (q4_g64_fp16 copies of
    131,072 output-head rows).
  - Tokenizer, chat template, generation and processor configs: stored unchanged as
    artifact resources.
  - README.md replaced; the conversion report added.
